+        // libmpeg pulls data from inside sceMpegGetPicture through the game's
+        // sceMpegCbNodata (type 1) callback. Games that read + demux only from that
+        // callback (no separate feeder thread) would otherwise wait forever once the
+        // decoded queue drains. Queue the callbacks as guest calls; when one finishes,
+        // wake the waiting GetPicture so it retries. A callback returning 0 means "no
